+## A turn whose `beforeSession` throws
+
+- A throw from `beforeSession` still reaches the caller as a rejection, with `onError` and `afterSession` both run before it ([validated by: runs onError and afterSession in order, then still rejects with the thrown error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L35)).
